      "failure_scenario": "HUDCO accelerates its loan book disbursements under government-backed affordable housing and urban infrastructure schemes (e.g., PM Awas Yojana expansion), causing interest income and total revenue to recover and grow at 8-12% YoY, completely inverting the forecast trajectory.",
      "risk": "High"
    },
